# Kirk, Enterprising Captain (4/3): "Whenever Kirk attacks while creatures you control have total power 8 or greater" (CR
# 508.3d, 603.4). Kirk and two Grizzly Bears are exactly 8 together, so the turn-3 attack exiles the top card of Bot1's
# library - an Island - and "You may play that card this turn" lets Bot1 play it from exile in Main2 (CR 701.13a, 701.18b).
# All three attack unblocked for 8.

